    <item>
      <title>Solved: How to Center a Div Horizontally and Vertically in CSS</title>
      <link>https://sqlpey.com/html/solved-how-to-center-a-div-horizontally-and-vertically-in-css/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sqlpey.com/html/solved-how-to-center-a-div-horizontally-and-vertically-in-css/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;solved-how-to-center-a-div-horizontally-and-vertically-in-css&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Solved: How to Center a Div Horizontally and Vertically in CSS&amp;rdquo;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;method-1-centering-with-css-flexbox-modern--recommended&#34;&gt;Method 1: Centering with CSS Flexbox (Modern &amp;amp; Recommended)&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Flexbox offers a powerful and straightforward approach for aligning elements, making it the preferred choice for modern web layouts. It provides excellent control over content distribution and alignment within a container.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To horizontally center a child element using Flexbox:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-css&#34; data-lang=&#34;css&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;#main-container {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;border&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;em&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;solid&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;#ff4500&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;/* Distinct red border */&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;width&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;%&lt;/span&gt;;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;display&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;flex&lt;/span&gt;;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;justify-content&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;center&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;/* Centers items along the main axis (horizontal) */&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;#child-element {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;border&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;em&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;solid&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;#000000&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;/* Solid black border */&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;main-container&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &amp;lt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;child-element&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;Centered Content Here&amp;lt;/&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To achieve both horizontal and vertical centering with Flexbox:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
